HarleyDroid EVO
===============

Harley Davidson J1850 / CAN Data Analyser for Android — evolution of the
original open-source HarleyDroid.  The "EVO" name marks both this
modern continuation and a nod to Harley-Davidson's Evolution (EVO) engine.

